dystopia-reactor-ui-title = Reactor console
dystopia-reactor-ui-scram = AZ-5
dystopia-reactor-ui-scram-tip = Emergency protection: every rod drops at emergency speed (~12 s). If the rods were fully out, for the first seconds their graphite displacers push power up!
dystopia-reactor-ui-reset-scram = Reset scram
dystopia-reactor-ui-reset-scram-tip = The rods obey their setpoints again; the setpoints are put down too, so raise them gradually.
dystopia-reactor-ui-disconnected = NO LINK: put the console against a column or lay a control cable
