dystopia-reactor-ui-gauges = Gauges
dystopia-reactor-ui-gauge-power = POWER
dystopia-reactor-ui-gauge-power-tip = Thermal power. The yellow line is what all channels can carry off with water; the triangle is the regulator setpoint.
dystopia-reactor-ui-gauge-temperature = TEMP
dystopia-reactor-ui-gauge-temperature-tip = The hottest column. Yellow line: siren; red line: columns burn through; triangle: automatic scram limit.
dystopia-reactor-ui-gauge-water = WATER
dystopia-reactor-ui-gauge-water-tip = Water in all drums. Without water the channels are not cooled and the reactor speeds up (void effect).
dystopia-reactor-ui-gauge-pressure = PRESS
dystopia-reactor-ui-gauge-pressure-tip = Steam pressure in the most loaded drum. Yellow: danger; red: the drum bursts.
