dystopia-reactor-ui-cell-scrammed = SCRAMMED · { $insertion }% in · group { $group }
dystopia-reactor-ui-cell-group = Group:
dystopia-reactor-ui-rods = Control rods
dystopia-reactor-ui-rods-tip = Insertion by group: red is the absorber in the channel, the white tick is where it is heading. 0% is out (more power), 100% is in. ▲ raises by 10%, ▼ lowers.
