dystopia-reactor-ui-all-out = All out
dystopia-reactor-ui-all-in = All in
dystopia-reactor-ui-auto-header = Automation
dystopia-reactor-ui-ar-on = Regulator (group 1): ON
dystopia-reactor-ui-ar-off = Regulator (group 1): OFF
dystopia-reactor-ui-ar-tip = Moves group 1 rods to hold thermal power at the setpoint. More than 20% over the setpoint, it drives them in at full speed; while the fuel is hotter than 450 °C it never pulls them out. Keep the setpoint below what the channels can carry off (the yellow line on the power gauge).
dystopia-reactor-ui-setpoint = setpoint { $setpoint } MW
dystopia-reactor-ui-autoscram-on = Auto scram: ON (above { $temperature } °C or ×2 cooling)
dystopia-reactor-ui-autoscram-off = Auto scram: OFF
dystopia-reactor-ui-autoscram-tip = If any column runs hotter than the limit, or power is twice what the channels can carry off, every rod drops.
